<title>FRANCE: Alcatel Alsthom sales fall 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Alsthom sales fall 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     111,583    vs  116,977</p>
<p>    Telecom				     46,565    vs     43,782</p>
<p>    Cables					27,437    vs     30,350</p>
<p>    GEC Alsthom				 21,052    vs     22,580</p>
<p>    Systems				     15,497    vs     14,512</p>
<p>    Batteries				    3,522    vs	3,168</p>
<p>    Other					  1,748    vs	5,713</p>
<p>    Inter group sales   loss		 4,238    vs loss 3,128</p>
<p>Note: The company released the figures in a statement. It said on a comparable basis, sales fell by 3.1 percent. It said orders rose 2.1 percent to 117.6 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
